  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1253768,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 - Nagusame no Houshuu (Nintendo Wii) - Synopsis\n\nEmbark on a breathtaking journey through a fractured, ethereal Japan in *007 - Nagusame no Houshuu*, a unique action RPG for the Wii. As a member of the elite \"007\" special forces unit, you are tasked with investigating a series of bizarre anomalies and disappearances linked to the mysterious \"Floating Citadel,\" a colossal, otherworldly structure that has materialized above the nation.\n\nThe Citadel’s arrival has warped reality, blending ancient folklore with futuristic technology, creating monstrous creatures and unsettling distortions.  Utilizing the Wii Remote for intuitive combat and exploration, players will master a dynamic blend of melee attacks, ranged weaponry, and supernatural abilities.  Team up with a diverse cast of characters, each possessing unique skills and backstories, to unravel the Citadel’s secrets and confront the malevolent force controlling it.  Discover the truth behind the disappearances, battle corrupted spirits, and ultimately, decide the fate of Japan in this visually stunning and emotionally resonant adventure. Prepare for a haunting and unforgettable experience."
    },
